# Keep LF line endings on checkout, on every platform.
#
# sweep.sh is read by bash, which treats a trailing CR as part of the shebang
# and fails with "/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory". Git on
# Windows converts to CRLF by default, so the endings are pinned here rather
# than left to each machine's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
